# Large-Scale Document Automation: The Systems Integration Issue.

**Authors:** Kalthoff, Robert J.

## Abstract
Reviews current technologies for electronic imaging and its recording and transmission, including digital recording, optical data disks, automated image-delivery micrographics, high-density-magnetic recording, and new developments in telecommunications and computers. The role of the document automation systems integrator, who will bring these disparate systems together, is also considered. (MBR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ327085

